  "compatibility": {
    "main_project": ">=0.1.0",
    "notes": "otdp 0.1.2 adds derived variables (descriptor derived_variables[] array, closed derivation marker on dataset variables; measurement-model.md section 8, M15/S19) and the S19 grammar/static checks including the ASCII digit gate. RE-VERSION OBLIGATION: the SDK's vendored tree is single-active-version, so a descriptor declaring otdp_version 0.1.1 no longer validates against the active 0.1.2 const \u2014 existing descriptors must re-version (the in-tree sim_scope plugin did); measurement datasets and schemas stay compatible (0.1.2 is additive). plugin-ui 0.1.1 carries row C's per-channel display hints (see its own compatibility note).",
